flowchart TD
    A[API Spec markdown] --> B[Parse endpoints and params]
    B --> C[AI: domain partitions per param]
    B --> D[AI: security checklist SEC-01 to SEC-07]
    B --> E[AI: schema from response examples]
    C --> F[Human audit gate]
    D --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G{Label VALID?}
    G -->|INVALID/INCOMPLETE| H[Fix expected and asserts]
    H --> F
    G -->|VALID| I[Extend >=5 TC from known bugs]
    I --> J[Export CSV test cases]
    J --> K[Generate Postman collection JSON]
    K --> L[Newman run with CSV data]
    L --> M{Pass?}
    M -->|Fail on bug TC| N[Bug report GitHub Issues]
    M -->|Pass| O[HTML report archive]
    N --> O
